# 由 KUI 导出脚本生成：文本按 LF 存放，shell 脚本检出时保持 LF。
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
# Go 源码检出时也保持 LF：Git for Windows 默认 core.autocrlf=true 会检出成 CRLF，gofmt -l 随即把全部文件列为未格式化。
*.go text eol=lf
# 运行库（runtime/<平台>/ 下的全部文件，含 LICENSE.FFmpeg*.txt）按字节存放：不做换行转换、不做文本 diff，
# 与 Release 上 SDK 包里的那份逐字节相同。
runtime/*/** binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.so binary
*.so.* binary
*.dylib binary
*.filamat binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.glb binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
